---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
import MemoryBox from '../components/MemoryBox.astro';

// The front door for stories that don't belong to any one photograph or
// film clip. Posts land in the "stories" discussion; the recollection
// exporter sweeps them into data/recollections/ like everything else.
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Tell a Story"
  description="A place for any story or memory from Larry's Army years — no photograph needed."
>
  <span class="eyebrow">For Dad</span>
  <h1>Tell a story</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    Not every memory has a picture. If a story comes to mind — from basic training, from
    Vietnam, from Japan, from the trip home, from anywhere in those years — it belongs here
    just as much. Big or small, funny or hard, half-remembered is fine.
  </p>
  <p>
    If the story <em>does</em> go with a picture or a piece of film, it's even better on that
    page — find it in the <a href={withBase('/photos/')}>photographs</a> or the
    <a href={withBase('/footage/')}>footage</a> and tell it there. Otherwise, this page is
    the place.
  </p>

  <MemoryBox
    term="stories"
    intro="Tell the story in the box below and press the Comment button. Anything helps — when it was, who was there, what happened. Your words will be saved exactly as you give them."
  />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
</style>
